Z||000001||Jim51||08-04-2000||12:34 AM||||They are # 70 bulbs. Went to all of the auto parts places. I could only find them at the dealer. They were about 2-3 bucks for one!||||reg||2
Z||000002||My7Fieros||08-04-2000||12:51 AM||||Yeah you'll be hard pressed to find the #70 bulbs anywhere......BUT... use #74, exact same thing, and you can find them at any auto parts store for a couple of bucks for a pack of two.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
